<title>JAPAN: BOJ to issue quarterly economic review on April 25.</title>
<headline>BOJ to issue quarterly economic review on April 25.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Friday it would release its quarterly economic outlook at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT) on April 25.</p>
</text>
